let __v_503 = Value::from("The others, from seed: salad leaves and radishes 4 to 6 weeks, beetroot 10 to 12, carrots and runner beans 12 to 16, peas 12 to 14, courgettes 10 to 12, sweetcorn 12 to 14, tomatoes 16 to 20 from sowing (12 to 16 from planting out), cabbages and broccoli 16 to 20, parsnips 22 to 24, and leeks or onions 20 to 24. Garlic takes about eight months from an autumn clove, and strawberries fruit the summer after planting. The seed packet is the tie-breaker, because a fortnight either way is normal.");
