let __v_1226 = Value::from("The edges will freeze in a hard frost and the heap slows to nothing, which is normal - the middle keeps going and it picks up again in spring. To keep it working, fork it into one bigger heap, keep the lid on and lay a sheet of cardboard or an old compost bag over the top; a heap that is cold in mild weather is a different problem, and that one wants greens and more bulk.");
